                        ],
                        "form": "unspiked"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "8cdfed56-3b5f-40a6-9829-0405c3a0557e",
                        "entry_id": "923ccc3d-fee5-315b-b00e-ffc050c28b74",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "unspiked"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8de4d25f-5645-3dd3-ab06-a35890d63e95",
                        "entry_id": "923ccc3d-fee5-315b-b00e-ffc050c28b74",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To remove a spike from."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "762d0ea6-25d8-4302-b746-d0869e0bdc69",
                                "sense_id": "8de4d25f-5645-3dd3-ab06-a35890d63e95",
                                "text": "To unspike a cannon, attempt to drive the spike into the bore with a punch; if this succeeds, and the bore be obstructed, introduce powder into the vent to force the obstacle out."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e032b8b8-de4d-4f3e-babe-aef2c3dbba92",
                                "sense_id": "8de4d25f-5645-3dd3-ab06-a35890d63e95",
                                "text": "However, neither the wording of the agreement nor the conduct of the parties under it lends support to the proposition that Signal Maintainers have a right either to demand that they be allowed to unspike and spike hand switches or that they be compensated when an employee of some other class performs such work."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "979e4ed6-3865-4398-bdba-6f6b80b6b851",
                                "sense_id": "8de4d25f-5645-3dd3-ab06-a35890d63e95",
                                "text": "It became necessary to move out some of the stored cars, and the carrier used a track foreman to unspike the switch. The spike had to be removed by the use of crowbars and other tools which were in the track foreman's custody."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee5dd9e6-aebd-4d4e-9d01-0a73348693de",
                                "sense_id": "8de4d25f-5645-3dd3-ab06-a35890d63e95",
                                "text": "Machine automatically unspikes the old bag and spikes the new bag ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5e9e318-2e60-4698-b941-84c8ffec5843",
                                "sense_id": "8de4d25f-5645-3dd3-ab06-a35890d63e95",
                                "text": "Oh, I'm penitent enough for the Seventh Heaven, but as to kneeling, observe, good friend, how the wicked have transfixed my extremities with nails! Why, bless you, I can move neither hand nor foot! Unspike me , friend - withdraw the iron restraints of the law and see how quickly I will kneel [upon the body of some one whom I hate. It is the dream of my life!]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf670785-74df-4bdd-88f2-0197b79aedad",
                                "sense_id": "8de4d25f-5645-3dd3-ab06-a35890d63e95",
                                "text": "He sent for some skilled blacksmiths to make the necessary tools to try to unspike them, and while this was being done, the lieutenant at Talut sent a soldier with a letter addressed to the commandant of the marines, to ask him whether he should obey the order he had received from his captain to spike the cannons."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8ea8b24-9e86-42f1-9248-0c067dde5164",
                                "sense_id": "8de4d25f-5645-3dd3-ab06-a35890d63e95",
                                "text": "unspiking the vent of a cannon"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be3a964b-4564-3622-a456-a16ba32ef60c",
                        "entry_id": "923ccc3d-fee5-315b-b00e-ffc050c28b74",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To make or become less spiky."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c30348b8-40ba-4f85-a20f-5f8a8ab40186",
                                "sense_id": "be3a964b-4564-3622-a456-a16ba32ef60c",
                                "text": "He can easily unspike his hair and float the skateboard down the river."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1175d1e2-1341-4bae-9080-704c8e9f32a9",
                                "sense_id": "be3a964b-4564-3622-a456-a16ba32ef60c",
                                "text": "Josie had interviewed Colt for an evening dispatcher's position about a year ago, but the girl had refused to unspike her hair or remove her facial piercings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0bd0084-d9eb-40fb-977d-3707c1aac58d",
                                "sense_id": "be3a964b-4564-3622-a456-a16ba32ef60c",
                                "text": "Her hair was beginning to unspike, and her clothes were plastered to her like a second skin."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "807de384-d0d2-3f16-9719-d675e751c716",
                        "entry_id": "923ccc3d-fee5-315b-b00e-ffc050c28b74",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To return to a normal level after a very high spike."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "cfa1a915-1e85-444a-a691-ceef2897ea88",
                                "sense_id": "807de384-d0d2-3f16-9719-d675e751c716",
                                "text": "The applied (or absorbed) microwave power in the plasma does not appear to have a first order affect on the conditions at which the plasma either spikes or unspikes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ad64c192-210a-4ff0-9063-5f453cbca829",
                                "sense_id": "807de384-d0d2-3f16-9719-d675e751c716",
                                "text": "And everybody thought for sure that this woman would never, ever leave the hospital. That she'd never unspike [ return to normal body temperature ], that she'd develop antibiotic-resistant germs, that she couldn't have physical therapy, couldn't have her wound handled couldn't have this stuff done."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d6967490-4bcd-4644-8bef-371bcfe80993",
                                "sense_id": "807de384-d0d2-3f16-9719-d675e751c716",
                                "text": "The TRACE images were calibrated using the TRACE instrument software package, trace-prep, including wave2point, destreak, deripple, unspike, and normalize."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1b46c66f-45eb-3a2a-8d52-898673c3a404",
                        "entry_id": "923ccc3d-fee5-315b-b00e-ffc050c28b74",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To neutralize the alcohol (or other adulterant) in a food, drink, or other substance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "872cc2cd-6c0d-4a02-92ea-2de7c0a2b13e",
                                "sense_id": "1b46c66f-45eb-3a2a-8d52-898673c3a404",
                                "text": "HOW TO UNSPIKE OUR SWEETS Our spiked desserts ( pages 104-105 ) have real punch!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
